:06:37.12,0:06:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.58,0:06:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buradayım Kin-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku! Bir şeyin yok ya?Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.95,0:06:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yok.Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.83,0:06:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lakin...Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Kalesi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.83,0:07:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.38,0:07:24.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin lütfen!Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.76,0:07:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden bana engel oluyorsun? Derhâl güvenliğini teyit etmeliyim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama'nın başına bir iş gelecek olursa...Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.55,0:07:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle aynı fikirdeyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.02,0:07:38.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat dert etmeniz gereken başka biri daha yok mu?Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.52,0:07:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tsuru...Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.40,0:07:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her an kendine gelip tekrar yakıp yıkabilir!Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.49,0:07:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O durumda Okobore Kasabası da...Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum, Okobore Kasabası'na gidiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.04,0:07:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku, Momonosuke-sama sana emanet!Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.35,0:08:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.51,0:08:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şekilde kaçtınız, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.75,0:08:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkadaşlar?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.00,0:08:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speed-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dayanın! Ne oldu size?Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.69,0:08:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speed-sama yanılmıyorsam kasaba dışına çıkmıştı!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.19,0:08:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demin Kaido-sama'nın üzerinden düşüverdi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speed-sama! Speed-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de necisin lan?Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.78,0:08:41.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kısrak!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kısrak!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speed-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.11,0:08:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen...Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada ne işin var?Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.85,0:08:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama nerede? Sağ salim evine götürdün, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.89,0:09:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlatsana, Kısrak!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.79,0:09:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolda Kaido-sama'ya yakalandık.Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.67,0:09:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dirensem de...Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,efendimi...Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,koruyamadım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.27,0:09:32.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nereye gidiyorsun bakayım, Speed?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.59,0:09:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kısrak-chan!Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.49,0:10:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tuhaf bir rapor kulağıma çalındı.Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.80,0:10:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçayım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.17,0:10:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizzat...Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.11,0:10:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,evine bırakmalıydım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.28,0:10:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-ya!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaptın oğlum sen? Kaçalım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.12,0:10:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ devasa formunda olduğundan neyin çarptığını anlamamıştır!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçma şansımız var!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama'yı öldürmüş.Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emonlar da...Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ikimizin mürettebatı da...Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sağ mı değil mi bilmiyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.11,0:11:10.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an hakkından gelirsem...Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tüm mesele çözülür, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.36,0:11:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buradayım lan!Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.31,0:11:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen...Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.82,0:11:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.56,0:12:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı olacak adamım!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patlayan Nefes!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.67,0:12:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek...Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.43,0:12:52.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya geldin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üçüncü Vites!Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.76,0:13:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden yaptı yani!Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.22,0:13:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm planımızı suya düşürdü!Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.55,0:15:04.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün içtiğim çorbayla elmanın tadını hayatım boyunca unutmayacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.59,0:15:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fil Mitralyözü!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.86,0:16:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni yere çivileyeceğim, Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.33,0:17:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.25,0:17:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bozayı...Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.05,0:17:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Magnumu!Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.14,0:18:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dördüncü Vites!Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçrayan Adam!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoldaşlarıma...Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.91,0:19:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ne cüretle el sürersin, adi herif!Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.67,0:19:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.55,0:19:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kong Silahı!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.03,0:20:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çifte Culverin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.11,0:20:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.62,0:20:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kong Organ!Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da kimin nesi?Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.53,0:22:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.88,0:22:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kral Kong Silahı!Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gök Gürültüsü Bagua!Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.99,0:24:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah şu aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.41,0:24:14.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözlerime inanamıyorum. Hâlâ nefes alıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.62,0:24:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşündüğüm gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.38,0:24:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.82,0:24:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yılmaz dövüşçü ruhundan mı yoksa kurusıkı mı atıyor bilmiyorum ama...Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dik dik bana bakıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.05,0:24:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana baygın gibi geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.56,0:25:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne tür bir kral olacağını söylemiştin,Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.76,0:25:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,velet?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.86,0:01:44.16,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Oden"Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.64,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,İmparator Kaido, Luffy'ye KarşıDialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video DüzenlemeDialogue: 1,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video DüzenlemeDialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,FeesoDialogue: 1,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,FeesoDialogue: 2,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.13,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,FeesoDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,ZamanlamaDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,ZamanlamaDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DizgiDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DizgiDialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:34.63,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Gab PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:00:30.21,0:0